[TEXT]
Title=Shadow weave (Powell)

[NOTES]
1=Powell shadow weave on 8 shafts.
2=Threading: point of A1 B1 C1 D1 E1 F1 G1 H1, then mirrored back, 30 ends per repeat.
3=Treadling: as drawn in.
4=Tie-up: standard twill direction.
5=Colors: warp and weft alternate dark and light, both starting dark (smooth block edges).
6=Size: 1 repeat across and 1 repeat up: 30 ends x 30 picks.

